They insisted rather than approached, but we're good friends, they've toured with us

01:36:13.750 --> 01:36:17.680
quite a lot, and they're on the same label as us in England, Mute Records.

01:36:17.680 --> 01:36:22.460
So we got to know them very well, and we'd get along really well, so it wasn't, you know,

01:36:22.460 --> 01:36:25.810
that problem had already been overcome before we started.

